			(property "Description" "The Raspberry Pi Compute Module 4 Rev 5 CM4104000 Lite features a 1.5GHz quad-core ARM Cortex-A72 processor and 4GB of RAM, making it ideal for a variety of applications. With 28 digital I/O lines and connectivity options including wireless, GbE Ethernet, I2C, SPI, and UART, this SBC offers extensive interfacing capabilities. The compact dimensions of 2.170 x 1.570 make it suitable for space-constrained projects. Additional features include USB 2.0, multiple video outputs (CSI, DPI, DSI, HDMI), and an operating temperature range of -20°C to 75°C, ensuring performance in diverse environments."
